    "name": "Tasman Peninsula Small-Group Guided Tour & Shore Excursions ",
    "shortDescription": "Tasman Peninsula, Highest Sea Cliffs, Oldest Settlement, Shore Excursion from Hobart\r\n塔斯曼半島｜全澳最高海崖｜最古老監獄｜秘境探險｜郵輪島上半日遊探險\r\n\r\n",
    "description": "<h3><b><u><br></u></b></h3><h3><b><u>Tasman Peninsula Day Tour :</u></b></h3><p><b><u><br></u></b></p><p><b>Duration:&nbsp;</b></p><p><b>8 hrs (Normal Itinerary)</b></p><p><b>6-6.5 hrs(Cruise Ships Excursions)</b></p><p><b><u><br></u></b></p>This is a remarkable opportunity to explore untamed nature and completely immerse yourself in breathtaking landscapes. Tasmania boasts an incredible array of biodiversity, with ancient forests and pristine oceans that have thrived for millions of years. Our tours provide an intimate outdoor experience, allowing you to reconnect with nature through leisurely walks in the stunning Tasman National Park. Tasmania offers a truly wild and invigorating environment—why not experience it firsthand and breathe in the crisp, fresh air?<br><br>● Spectacular coastal scenery and high cliffs<br><br>● Encounter wildlife and enjoy guide insights <br><br>● Island vibes sharing and caring <br><br>● Beautiful local food and shops&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<p><br></p><h4><u><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\">What is Include:</span></u></h4><p>National Park Pass ｜Air-con Bus ｜Guided Tour</p><p></p><p><b><u><br></u></b></p><b><u><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\">What is Not Include:</span></u></b><p>Lunch｜Personal Expense ｜Travel Insurance</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a><b>Pick Up Point</b><br><b>Prices Wharf to Tasman Peninsula</b><br><b>Princes Wharf No. 1, Castray Esplanade, Hobart </b></a></p><b>**Tour starts from 08:30am///Hotel Pick-Up is available**</b><p><b><br></b></p><p></p><h4><b><u>Itinerary:</u></b></h4><p><span><br><b>Tasman Bay National Park Lookout </b><br>Entering into a spectacular view of the ocean<br>and land. Enjoy tea/coffee in these beautiful places. <br><br><br><b>Tessellated Pavement</b><br>Tessellated pavement is extremely rare. This<br>natural phenomenon is only found in a few places on Earth where rocks have<br>fractured into polygonal blocks and appear just like man-made tiles. The place<br>is also famous for sunrise and sunset.<br><br><br><b>Tasman Arch｜Devil's Kitchen</b><br>Tasmans Arch is a tall natural bridge in the sea<br>cliffs of the Tasman Peninsula, that has also been carved out by the Tasman<br>Sea. This beautiful geological formation is one of many that can be visited at<br>Eaglehawk Neck and along the eastern side of the Tasman Peninsula. ps: Optional<br>to Waterfall Bay lookout<br><br><br><b>Port Arthur Lavender</b><span> <b>Farm</b></span></span></p><p><span>Lunch or cup of coffee with a beautiful<br>experience of lavender. It is worth having the ice cream and the Lavender<br>products in the shop.<br><br><br><b>Remarkable Cave</b></span></p><p>Enjoy the vista from Maignon Bay Lookout of the</p><p>rugged southern coastline before descending the steps to the spectacular<br>Remarkable Cave. Enjoy a 15-minute walk return and be prepared to get a little<br>wet! <span><br><br></span><br><b>Tasmanian Chocolate Foundry</b></p><p>Nestled in the heart of the Tasman Peninsula in</p><p>Taranna on the rugged East Coast of Tasmania you will find the perfect stop on</p><p>your travels. The Tasmanian Chocolate Foundry manufactures a large range of<br>hand-forged chocolate products. Indulge yourself in all things chocolate, using<br>the finest Belgian Coverture chocolate there is sure to be something to<br>tantalize the tastebuds. <span><br><br><br><b>Drop off point &amp; time to say goodbye</b></span></p><p>The tour is heading back to the starting point.</p><p><br></p><h4><strong><u>Tasman Peninsula Shore Excursion:</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-medium\">Discover Tasmania’s wild coastline straight from your cruise ship! Our Tasman Peninsula Shore Excursion offers a seamless, small-group adventure designed for cruise passengers. Explore dramatic sea cliffs, visit historic Port Arthur, encounter local wildlife, and experience the island’s untamed beauty — all within your cruise schedule. Personalized, flexible, and unforgettable — this is Tasmania beyond the ordinary.</span></h4><p><br></p><li><p><strong>Cruise-friendly pick-up and return</strong> — tours designed to fit your cruise schedule.</p></li><li><br><p><strong>Small-group experience</strong> — personalized and comfortable travel.</p></li><li><br><p><strong>Explore Tasmania’s wild coastline</strong> — including the stunning Tasman Peninsula.</p></li><li><br><p><strong>Visit historic Port Arthur</strong> — rich in heritage and stories.</p></li><li><br><p><strong>Encounter local wildlife</strong> — seals, dolphins, seabirds, and more.</p></li><li><br><p><strong>Authentic Tasmanian adventure</strong> — connecting nature, history, and local life.</p></li><br><li><p><strong>Seamless, flexible, and unforgettable</strong> — ideal for cruise passengers seeking more than just sightseeing.</p></li><h4><i><br></i></h4><h4><i><br></i></h4><h4><i><br></i></h4><h4><i>Cruise Ships - Pick Up &amp;Ｄrop Off Point : Mac 02 ///&nbsp;18 Hunter St, Hobart TAS 7000</i><br><i>Pick Up Time: 0800am-0830am</i></h4><h4><i>Total Tour Duration: 6hr-6.5hr&nbsp;</i></h4><p><i><br></i></p><b><br></b><br><h4><b><u>中文導覽行程:</u></b></h4><p><b><u></u></b></p><p></p><p>雖然該地區以<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8D%B7%E5%85%B0\">荷蘭</a>探險家<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E8%B4%9D%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E5%A1%94%E6%96%AF%E6%9B%BC\">阿貝爾·塔斯曼</a>的名字命名，在歐洲人到來之前，這一地區居民的原住民為派德雷麥（pyder-remer ）人。他們居住的地方現在稱為塔斯曼和福里斯蒂爾半島。</p><p>1830年代初，歐洲人在半島的<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%9A%E7%91%9F%E6%B8%AF_(%E5%A1%94%E6%96%AF%E6%9B%BC%E5%B0%BC%E4%BA%9A%E5%B7%9E)\">亞瑟港</a>建立了第一個居住地。由於它在地理上孤立於其他的殖民地，因此被選為關押犯人的地方，並且相比位於西海岸的另一個關押犯人地點<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BA%A6%E6%A0%BC%E7%90%86%E6%B8%AF\">麥格理港</a>，從海上更容易到達這裡。它還提供優良的製作船隻和其他建築工程的木材，並且是一個深水港，可用於英國軍艦的修復。在鷹頸設立警衛和警犬後，罪犯就很難逃脫。</p><p>亞瑟港的犯人關押地如今已經成為一個旅遊景點。和大部分洲一樣，旅遊已經成為一個主要產業。在政府大力積極推動觀光的促使下，塔斯曼半島擁有著塔斯人的後山與後花園之稱。由於動、植物種的多樣化，這裡是研究家長年觀察的基地。再來就是擁有著多樣化的天然地形和健走山巒，著名的健走行程『Three Capes Track』就是坐落於此。每年吸引者大量的遊客來此親自見證這大自然的鬼斧神工，配合國家公園每一年在健走步道上的更新建設。塔斯曼半島已經成為非常成熟的一日旅遊/多日旅遊的必要觀光勝地。</p><p></p><h4><u>行程景點:&nbsp;</u></h4><br><p>Tasman Bay National Park Lookout</p><p>塔斯曼半島/<br>享受半島觀景台山與海的結合</p><p>《春、夏季每週三到周天有咖啡小車Cubed. Espresso Bar的陪伴》冬季營業時間不同</p><p></p><p>Tessellated Pavement</p><p>棋盤岩石/<br>是一種特殊的海洋景象，這裡是海洋保護區</p><p>沉浸在大自然的鬼斧神工下所刻畫的美麗海岸線，旅人特別喜歡在日出與日落拍下她美麗動人的面貌</p><p></p><p>Devil's Kitchen</p><p>塔斯曼拱門/<br>體驗侏儸紀時期的岩石峭壁</p><p>玄武岩的質地給這海岸線帶來無可比擬的風景</p><p>沿岸海浪不斷地拍打，鍛造出奇特的海蝕洞景象</p><p></p><p><b> </b>Port Arthur Lavender/ Enjoy a Beautiful LUNCH in Lavender Farm</p><p>午餐/亞瑟港薰衣草花園<br>享受在美麗的薰衣草花園裡用餐，這裡每一項食品與產品都是農場主人用心經營的結晶</p><p></p><p>Remarkable Cave</p><p>非凡洞穴/<br>擁有最經典的海蝕洞景象，從洞口探出去隱約可以看見塔斯馬尼亞的形狀</p><p>在每個月最低潮的時刻有機會可以步行探索海蝕洞的樣貌，是個典型的海岸洞穴</p><p></p><p>Tasmanian Chocolate Foundry</p><p>塔斯曼巧克力工廠/<br>這裡的巧克力都是純手工製作而成，巧克力本身是源自於比利時</p><p>入口即化、絲滑順口，每一口都能感受到職人用心的態度</p><p>此店不僅有食用的巧克力，還有實用的巧克力商品。例如: 肥皂、香精、茶葉等等。另外，還能夠體驗到塔斯馬尼亞的冰淇淋的魅力</p><p></p><h4><u>行程包含:</u></h4><u></u><br><p>國家公園入園證/</p><p>空調冷氣小巴士/</p><p>x1 飲用水/人</p><p></p><h4><u>行程不包含:</u></h4><u></u><br><p>各人消費/</p><p>中餐/</p><p><br></p><h3 class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\"><p><a><b>**集合地點**✨</b><br><b>Prices Wharf to Tasman Peninsula / Bruny Island</b><br><b>Princes Wharf No. 1, Castray Esplanade, Hobart</b></a></p><b><i>**行程出發時間 0830 a.m.** ///</i></b><b><i>**飯店接駁OK**&nbsp;</i></b></h3><p><b><i><br></i></b></p><h3><br></h3><h3><strong><u>塔斯曼半島岸上觀光行程: (從荷巴特港口出發)&nbsp;</u></strong></h3><h3><br></h3><p>從您的郵輪直接啟程，探索塔斯馬尼亞最壯麗的海岸線！我們的塔斯曼半島岸上觀光行程專為郵輪旅客設計，提供無縫接駁與小團制體驗。沿途欣賞壯觀的海崖景色、參觀歷史悠久的亞瑟港遺址、邂逅野生動物，親身感受這座島嶼原始而純粹的自然之美。靈活安排、貼心服務、難忘體驗——帶您發現不一樣的塔斯馬尼亞。</p><p><br></p><p><strong>貼心郵輪接送</strong> — 行程專為郵輪時程設計，輕鬆銜接不錯過。</p><p><strong>小團制體驗</strong> — 個人化旅遊，舒適又有溫度。</p><p><strong>探索塔斯馬尼亞野性海岸</strong> — 包含壯麗的塔斯曼半島景觀。</p><p><strong>參觀歷史悠久的亞瑟港</strong> — 感受豐富的文化遺產與動人故事。</p><p><strong>邂逅野生動物</strong> — 海豹、海豚、海鳥等近距離體驗自然生態。</p><p><strong>真實的塔斯馬尼亞探險</strong> — 結合自然、歷史與在地生活。</p><p><strong>無縫、靈活、難忘的旅程</strong> — 為追求不只是觀光的郵輪旅客量身打造。</p><p><br></p><h4><i>大船港口接駁: Mac 02 ///&nbsp;18 Hunter St, Hobart TAS 7000</i><br><i>接駁時間: 0800am-0830am</i></h4><h4><strong><i>總行程時段 6hr-6.5hr&nbsp;</i></strong></h4><p><strong><i><br></i></strong></p><p><b><i>給您體驗在荷巴特郵輪岸上探險半日遊的魅力，趕快訂下您與我們的探險旅程吧!</i></b></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
